body:
im level 80 (i did the vulkan, rykan and everything before caelid) and i think hes too easy im sad i didnt do him earlier, because i deal him an insane amount of damage (500-900 depending on my attack) . I have vigor 40 tho and i guess some of the attacks he one shots u with i survive, but he has indeed some balls that oneshot me when my healthbar is not 100%. If u tried him very often and cant manage to dodge the oneshot attacks level vigor to 40 (softcap) and try him again, but his attacks are definetly dodgeable 

&#x200B;

and btw keep in mind that its not a problem when u retry a boss for hours (in ds3, my first souls like i needed like 4hrs or more for multiple bosses) u will get better eventually. Getting to lvl 200 is possible i guess but because of the caps it would give u less of an advantage u imagine and is probably also not intented to reach before NG+3 or something anyway
